gm-method (MessageHandler inbound allowlist silently drops novel message types): MessageHandler.js inbound allowlist was DROPPING WORLD_SAVED (and any novel message type) silently. When a new message type is added to the wire protocol, it must ALSO be added to the server MessageHandler allowlist or it is silently dropped. Also: gizmo snap-back was caused by app.js onStateUpdate resetting position without editor.isDragging() guard. Camera thrash on exit was caused by a dead input.editToggle line calling setEditMode(false) every frame producing [true,false] oscillation -- remove the dead input line, not add another guard.